OL,3,ARussia struck train near Poland border
OL,4,Ashortly after Boris Johnson and top
OL,5,AEuropean officials passed through
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Russian strike has hit a train near
OL,8,Fthe Ukraine-Poland border shortly after
OL,9,Fformer UK Prime Minister Boris Johnson
OL,10,Fand other top European officials had
OL,11,Fpassed through.
OL,13,FNo casualties were reported after the
OL,14,FRussian strike, which hit the train's
OL,15,Fengine.
OL,17,FJohnson and some of Europe's most
OL,18,Fsenior security advisers, including the
OL,19,FUK's Jonathan Powell, had passed along
OL,20,Fthe same line on their way back from a
OL,21,Fconference in the capital, Kyiv.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
