OL,3,ARussia struck train near Poland border
OL,4,Ashortly after Boris Johnson and top
OL,5,AEuropean officials passed through
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussia said Sunday it struck "railway
OL,8,Finfrastructure" in western Ukraine, but
OL,9,Fthe former PM said "I don't know what
OL,10,Fwarped logic drove Putin to blow up a
OL,11,Fstationary Ukrainian locomotive on the
OL,12,FPolish border this morning" and asked
OL,13,F"When are we going to give them the air
OL,14,Fdefences they need?"
